{#
  Conversation summary partial, v5 (design s05-memory D7). Only when the session has a
  summary: the cumulative summary of the turns that left the window and were not
  anchored, written by the summarizer in the session language and normalized in code (no
  prompt tags, at most 2000 characters). Printed verbatim; the rules tell the model to
  treat it as data, and it yields to the current message, the verbatim turns and the
  project metadata.
  Each block emits its own leading blank line, so nothing is left behind when absent.
#}
{% if conversation_summary %}


<conversation_summary>
{{ conversation_summary }}
</conversation_summary>
{%- endif %}
